      "name": "Channel Product Distribution Mapping",
      "description": "Core domain for managing how accommodation products are distributed across sales channels (OTAs, direct booking sites, etc.). Covers the full lifecycle of channel-product relationships including: product-to-channel mapping (ChannelProductMap), channel-specific product status tracking (ChannelProductStatus), yield/pricing adjustments per channel (ChannelYieldMap, ChannelProductYieldMap), promotional pricing per channel (ChannelPromoMap), channel-specific product text/descriptions (ChannelProductText), rule groups governing channel behavior (ChannelRuleGroup), and party-to-product associations for channel distribution (ChannelPartyToProduct). Includes rich state management via multiple enums (ChannelStateEnum, BuildTypeEnum, PortalState) and custom MyBatis type handlers for persisting these states. This is a high-complexity domain central to the multi-channel distribution strategy of the platform.",
