    {
      "name": "Base Pricing",
      "description": "Core pricing entity for accommodation products. Manages seasonal/daily base prices with date-range granularity. Includes specialized MyBatis type handlers for UTC date conversion, LocalDate/LocalDateTime mapping, and string encoding \u2014 indicating the pricing data requires careful timezone-aware storage and possibly encoded/encrypted price values. PriceConstants defines pricing state enumerations. This is the foundational pricing layer that channel-specific yield adjustments (in channel-product-map) build upon.",
